WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.687
Commissioner Brenda Lucki, 2018 to 2023.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.850
Retired under pressure.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:12.225
The Nova Scotia mass shooting killed 22 people in a 13-hour rampage.

00:00:12.225 --> 00:00:17.287
The RCMP failed to issue an emergency alert for over 12 hours.

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:22.137
The Mass Casualty Commission found catastrophic failures at every level.

00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:26.412
Leaked notes showed political interference in the investigation.
